<LegalLayout title="Cookie Notice" description="The cookies and local storage used by the Quark website." updated="January 15, 2026">
  <h2>What cookies are</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies and similar technologies such as local storage are small pieces of data a website stores on your device to
    remember information between visits.
  </p>
  <h2>What this site uses</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Preference storage.</strong> We store a single value in your browser's local storage to remember that you
      have acknowledged this cookie notice. It contains no personal information and never leaves your device.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Fonts.</strong> Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts. Google may receive your IP address as part of
      serving the font files.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What this site does not use</h2>
  <p>We do not use advertising cookies, cross-site tracking or third-party analytics on this website.</p>
  <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
  <p>
    You can clear local storage and cookies at any time through your browser settings. Doing so will cause the cookie
    notice to appear again on your next visit.
  </p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions may be sent to <a href="mailto:privacy@quark.energy">privacy@quark.energy</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
